1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:04,166
Anyone who disobeys
will be executed immediately.

2
00:00:04,166 --> 00:00:05,750
We accept!

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,416
We accept everything!

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,875
David, Jack, come here.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,875
Their castles, carriages, jewels, gold,

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,625
 take whatever you want.

7
00:00:19,541 --> 00:00:20,541
Severin, 

8
00:00:21,125 --> 00:00:24,416
I mean, Godfather, is this real?

9
00:00:24,625 --> 00:00:26,125
Just call me Severin.

10
00:00:26,625 --> 00:00:28,125
Of course it’s real.

11
00:00:28,166 --> 00:00:31,250
I told you I could make
you anything you wanted to be.

12
00:00:31,666 --> 00:00:33,375
I keep my word.

13
00:00:33,375 --> 00:00:35,166
- Thank you, Severin!
- Thank you, Severin!

14
00:00:39,416 --> 00:00:44,125
This is Elowen Morellan, heir of
the Morellan family, 

15
00:00:46,125 --> 00:00:47,416
and my wife.

16
00:00:50,041 --> 00:00:52,125
I expect all of
you to support her

17
00:00:52,125 --> 00:00:53,875
and the Morellan
family from now on.

18
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,250
Severin… are you truly the Godfather?

19
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:02,000
Yes.

20
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:06,333
My Lady!

21
00:01:08,625 --> 00:01:09,125
Oh God!

22
00:01:09,916 --> 00:01:12,125
Cassia, protect my mother.

23
00:01:12,416 --> 00:01:14,625
Elowen, come with me.

24
00:01:17,625 --> 00:01:18,625
What’s wrong?

25
00:01:18,625 --> 00:01:21,500
The Black Dragon
Covenant issued an ultimatum.

26
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,500
Twelve hours.

27
00:01:24,291 --> 00:01:28,750
If we don't comply, the
Four Great Families are done.

28
00:01:28,750 --> 00:01:30,125
What do they want?

29
00:01:30,125 --> 00:01:33,625
Submit to them and
supply endless energy crystals.

30
00:01:33,916 --> 00:01:37,041
So the proposal
was just a cover.

31
00:01:37,041 --> 00:01:40,625
You really came for help.

32
00:01:40,625 --> 00:01:42,625
The help I need is real.

33
00:01:42,625 --> 00:01:45,416
But my feelings are more real.

34
00:01:46,125 --> 00:01:48,125
I fell in love
with you 

35
00:01:48,125 --> 00:01:50,625
the day you destroyed the Skeleton Legion

36
00:01:50,625 --> 00:01:54,125
and founded the Sovereign Sanctum.

37
00:01:54,125 --> 00:01:57,791
Don't worry. I'll handle this.

38
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,125
I trust you.

39
00:02:02,291 --> 00:02:04,250
They have undying knights,

40
00:02:04,250 --> 00:02:06,875
but my father says you
can save all of Golantis.

41
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Your father is right.

42
00:02:11,916 --> 00:02:14,125
The Black Dragon Covenant may be
powerful,

43
00:02:14,125 --> 00:02:16,041
but to me they’re nothing.

44
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,500
I’ll contact the Black Dragon right now

45
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,333
through the Void Realm.
